@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
title QuakeShift: proposed components and interfaces

component "GEOFON / replay files" as Source <<external>>
component "EMSC catalogue" as EMSC <<external>>
actor Researcher
package "Detection pipeline" {
  component "Ingestor / replay adapter" as Ingest
  component "RabbitMQ\nlive + background jobs; picks" as Broker
  component "Picker workers\nSTA/LTA / PhaseNet / EQTransformer" as Pick
  component "Associator\nspatial + temporal matching" as Assoc
  component "Results API" as API
  component "Evaluation job" as Eval
}
package "Persistence" {
  database "PostgreSQL\njobs, policies, picks, events" as DB
  folder "Waveform archive" as Raw
}
package "Adaptation and operations" {
  component "Resource / carbon controller" as Control
  component "Kubernetes API" as Kube <<platform>>
  component "Carbon simulator" as Carbon
  component "Prometheus" as Prom
  component "Grafana" as Grafana
  component "Service / resource exporters\n+ CodeCarbon measurement adapter" as Metrics
}

Source --> Ingest : SeedLink stream / file replay
Ingest --> Raw : file I/O: waveform windows
Ingest --> DB : SQL: jobs + pending publications
Ingest --> Broker : AMQP: job messages
Broker --> Pick : AMQP: live / background jobs
Pick --> Raw : file I/O: read waveforms
Pick --> DB : SQL: policy, picks, progress
Pick --> Broker : AMQP: arrival picks
Broker --> Assoc : AMQP: picks
Assoc --> DB : SQL: event revisions
API --> DB : SQL: event queries
Researcher --> API : HTTP/JSON: GET /events
EMSC --> Eval : HTTP: catalogue snapshot
Eval --> API : HTTP/JSON: detected events
Eval --> DB : SQL: evaluation metrics
Carbon --> Control : timestamped intensity samples
Control --> DB : SQL: policy / deferred jobs
Control --> Broker : AMQP: background jobs
Control --> Prom : HTTP/PromQL: lag + usage
Control --> Kube : HTTPS: capacity, scale, rollout, rollback
Kube ..> Pick : manages worker pods
Prom --> Metrics : HTTP: GET /metrics
Grafana --> Prom : HTTP/PromQL: dashboards + alerts

note bottom of Broker
  Job: run/station/window IDs, waveform URI,
  model + policy version, live/background class.
  Pick: station, arrival time, P/S, confidence,
  model + job ID. Consumers acknowledge work.
end note
note bottom of Metrics
  Collect from services, broker and cluster;
  export energy and scenario carbon metrics.
end note
@enduml
